<title>USA: Eastern rejects proposal to sell company.</title>
<headline>Eastern rejects proposal to sell company.</headline>
<dateline>NAUGATUCK, Conn. 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastern Co said on Wednesday its shareholders rejected a proposal to sell the company.</p>
<p>Earlier today, Millbrook Capital, which was advocating a plan to &quot;maximize shareholder value,&quot; said its three nominees to Eastern's board were not elected.</p>
</text>
